<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia port strike to be lifted Thursday night.</title>
<headline>Colombia port strike to be lifted Thursday night.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The crippling nine-day-old dock workers' strike at Colombia's main Pacific coast port of Buenaventura should be lifted by &quot;about&quot; 2200 local/0300 GMT Thursday, a union official said.</p>
<p>The move follows an agreement reached just before 1300 local/1800 GMT between dockers' representatives, ship owners and cargo operators after protracted negotiations in the provincial capital Cali.</p>
</text>
